**Priority:** pick hidden halo for the side-view detail, not the face-up size. Pair with V-tip six-prong centre spec at order. Match with a petite shank. Everything else is personal preference. See the full [marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond) for shape fundamentals.

