## Hidden Halo vs Visible Halo vs Solitaire — Side-by-Side

<table class="dc-custom-table"><thead><tr><th>Factor</th><th>Hidden Halo</th><th>Visible Halo</th><th>Solitaire</th><th>What this means</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Face-up size trick</strong></td><td>None</td><td>1.5x visual multiplier</td><td>None</td><td>Visible halo wins face-up size.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Side-view detail</strong></td><td>Hidden sparkle flash</td><td>Visible halo under stone</td><td>Plain basket</td><td>Hidden halo wins the subtle-reveal play.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tip protection</strong></td><td>None added (needs V-tip)</td><td>Partial (halo wraps tips)</td><td>Depends on prongs</td><td>Visible halo wins tip protection.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Profile height</strong></td><td>Low (6–7 mm)</td><td>Medium (8–10 mm)</td><td>Low (6–7 mm)</td><td>Hidden halo + solitaire tie on daily-wear practicality.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Starting price</strong></td><td>$1,255</td><td>$1,255</td><td>$790</td><td>Solitaire cheapest. Hidden + visible halo both start at $1,255.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Setting ceiling</strong></td><td>$3,230</td><td>$5,985</td><td>$2,850</td><td>Visible halo scales highest in design detail.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Best for</strong></td><td>Clean solitaire look + sparkle secret</td><td>Max visual carat</td><td>Timeless classic</td><td>Pick based on top-down vs side-view priority.</td></tr></tbody></table>

**Verdict:** Hidden halo is the setting for buyers who want the clean solitaire silhouette from above with a sparkle surprise from the side. Visible halo is the setting for buyers who want the biggest-looking stone. Solitaire is the setting for buyers who want timeless and cheapest. All three accept the same marquise centre — the choice is pure aesthetic preference. See [marquise halo engagement ring](/marquise-halo-engagement-ring) and [marquise solitaire engagement ring](/marquise-solitaire-engagement-ring) for the full breakdown of each.

