onal">Lace Bridge Hidden Halo + Pavé Platinum</a></td><td>$2,765</td><td>$6,048</td><td>Full-feature hidden halo. See <a href="/2-5-carat-marquise-diamond-price">2.5ct guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3ct marquise</strong></td><td>~$3,819 lab</td><td>~$54,687 natural</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/blue-nile-studio-petite-french-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-3-ct-tw-item-195817?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Petite French Pavé Crown Platinum</a></td><td>$3,230</td><td>$7,049</td><td>Statement tier. See <a href="/3-carat-marquise-diamond-price">3ct guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

