> **"For my clients who want 'something modern but not showy,' hidden halo is the first setting I recommend. It gives them the confidence of a classic solitaire silhouette with a design secret only they know about. When the hand turns, the ring flashes. That reveal is intimate — nobody else sees the hidden halo unless they look closely. For a certain type of buyer, that privacy is the whole appeal."** — Farzana Hasan, GIA Diamond Expert

